essay:
Objectives and Learning outcomes:

-Properly learn and use the English expressions needed to do the job as a tour guide, practise and apply the common features of English for Tourism in real work situations;

-	Use proper speaking., listening, reading, writing skills to communicate with the guests to get tourist information, introduce the visitors to tourist attractions in some provinces in the Central of Vietnam, comprehend the text about tour arrangement for guests;

- 	Seriously apply the learning approaches to put into practice .
